.VIA, LYS, MUS, D.ELSA, CEX, D.BSRA, D.ADDCP, D.ADMP, D.ADNP, A.COMC, D.CYTOF, D.LUM, D.MSI, D.WBLT', 'Cell Culture, Cell Extraction, Flow Cytometry, Cell Culture and Organoid Generation, Cell Isolation, Organ-on-a-Chip Device Fabrication, Patient-Derived Xenograft (PDX) Cell Line Generation, Cell Line Creation, Cell Sorting, iPSC Chondrogenic Differentiation and Chondronoid Formation', 'Cell Culture, Cell Culture and Organoid Generation, Cell Imaging, Flow Cytometry, Luminex Multiplex Immunoassay, Mass Spectrometry Proteomics, Cell Viability Assay, Cell Lysate Preparation, CometChip Assay, Organ-on-a-Chip Device Fabrication, Patient-Derived Xenograft (PDX) Cell Line Generation, DNA Extraction, Cell Isolation, RNA Extraction, ELISA, Antibody-Dependent Functional Profiling (ADFP), Bacterial Survivability Restriction Assay, Library Creation, Bacterial Extraction, Cell Extraction, CyTOF, Fourier Transform Infrared Spectroscopy (FTIR), Imaging, Immunopeptidomics, MALDI Mass Spectrometry Imaging (MALDI-MSI), Protein Extraction, SureQuant Analysis, Tissue Sectioning, Western Blot, iPSC Chondrogenic Differentiation and Chondronoid Formation', NULL, NULL);
