ay, Spatial Proteomics, Cell Imaging, PET/CT Scan, Histopathology, Tissue Sectioning, Magnetic Resonance Imaging (MRI), Cyclic Immunofluorescence (CyCIF), Atomic Force Microscopy (AFM), Immunohistochemistry, Intravital Microscopy', 'Imaging Analysis, Migration Assay Analysis, Cancer Cell Extravasation Analysis, Comet Chip Analysis, Permeability Analysis, MRI Analysis, Clot Modeling Analysis, Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) Assay, Histopathology Analysis, RaDR Fluorescence Microscopy Image Machine Learning Analysis, PET/CT Scan Analysis, Spatial Transcriptomics, Analyzed Spatial Proteomics, cyCIF Analysis', '{"BioImage Archive": {"Files": "D.IMG::File_PrimaryData", "ImageAcquisition.imaging_instrument": "D.IMG::Instrument", "ImageAcquisition.image_acquisition_parameters": "D.IMG::ObjectiveLens", "Specimen.sample_preparation": "D.IMG::Protocol", "Study.publications": "D.IMG::DOI"}}', NULL);
